  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>for</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;to exist.</p><p>Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;true for all&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>.</p><p>Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns